    "title": "What are the Coachella lineup times? See when Jack White performs",
    "text": "COACHELLAWhat are the Coachella lineup times? See when Justin Bieber performsJennifer Cortez Shad Powers Ema SasicPalm Springs Desert SunApril 6, 2026Updated April 7, 2026, 10:24 a.m. PT(This story was updated with additional information.)The 2026 Coachella Music and Arts Festival has released its set times for Weekend 1 — and added a new Hall of Fame name to the lineup.Coachella 2026 set timesPop singer Sabrina Carpenter is scheduled to take the Coachella Stage at 9:05 p.m. Friday, April 10, followed by first-time Coachella lineup performer Justin Bieber at 11:25 p.m. Saturday, April 11, and the first Latina headliner Karol G at 9:55 p.m. Sunday, April 12.",
